MP2 Y B VDD VDD PMOS L=100u W=100u
MN1 Y A n1 n1 NMOS L=100u W=100u
MN2 n1 B GND GND NMOS L=100u W=100u
.ends NAND2
.subckt NAND3 A B C Y VDD GND
